{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a06eda21f554ee2aad6194890dad09a2f15a4042eaad09a31e938d9663aef802", "ja": "（今日は仕事の後、未来を家まで送ることになった）", "zh": "（今天下班后，决定送未来回家）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6cd15a4c25a8ce8d079966c998a505fc5c0230ff69d7f1e5dd361ca9a012639c", "ja": "今日も随分対決してたな。\nレッスンもあったのに……大丈夫だったか？", "zh": "今天也真是较量了不少啊。\n明明还有课程……没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "26350242ffbf89d65e8ade10e3a180e58cd4b3dcaaf58b01aa60c8d8509e794c", "ja": "海美さんと会えるタイミングが今日しかなくて……\nアクロバティック縄跳び、すごかったな～。", "zh": "今天只有今天这个时机能见到海美姐……\n杂技跳绳，真是太厉害了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "12febda67ae7f6fe76441cf2a58e3b3886bbb40eb4aa4e2b642d89221e758bd2", "ja": "脚パンパンで、その後の翼との対決、子鹿みたいに\nプルプルしちゃいました。でも楽しかった～！", "zh": "腿都酸胀了，后来和翼对决的时候，抖得像只小鹿一样。不过还是很开心——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1004_p", "source_sha256": "777697ce471fcac45133397621bcee0c266b9cd66c207046614e9c6d4516631c", "ja": "帰ったらちゃんとケアするんだぞ。\n疲れが明日に残るといけないからな。", "zh": "回去之后一定要好好做下护理啊。\n要是疲劳留到明天就不好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "899b50302877fc28b11c9f8566bf9058e0fdf71d8bf97a8887a7c953dad4841e", "ja": "はーい、お風呂でマッサージしまーす。\nあ、お風呂対決とか、まだやってないかも？", "zh": "好——回去后我会在浴室里好好按摩的。\n啊，说起来，我们好像还没比过谁能在浴缸里泡得更久吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1006_p", "source_sha256": "18df37e3b8396bde46feca59d53cb110d9b3c369b61aee572a445becc1ca9bc0", "ja": "お風呂にどれだけ長く浸かれるか……とか？\nのぼせそうだし、危ないからやめた方がいい。", "zh": "比如比比谁能在浴缸里泡得更久……之类的？\n会泡晕的，而且很危险，还是别做了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "c5aacbc3a4f3917eee804bb2eccbff9a6d9d7fffffb26538c8b55c155dac619e", "ja": "そっか、それもそうですね！　じゃあ、\nどれだけアヒルを積めるかとか？　う～ん……。", "zh": "这样啊，说得也是！那么，\n比比谁能叠起更多小鸭子？嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8c2d5552c9f927c8c8bf994428f020b3670a3a6dc0b2092209b4ba7f5918c319", "ja": "そろそろコンプリートしそうな勢いだな。皆も\n盛り上がっているし、未来も楽しそうでよかったよ。", "zh": "看样子差不多就要集齐了。大家也都很兴奋，未来看起来也很开心，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "7fc18004408a223c0c83cc445148ee3adfe9a73562426b4e1e69ac73a9cd681f", "ja": "はい！　……あ、でも私、まだ、\nどうしても対決したい人と勝負できてないんです。", "zh": "是！……啊，不过我还没能和那个无论如何都想一决胜负的人比试。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1010_p", "source_sha256": "46e7661927aacb6e0758c01782b7218d08691b43cc1dd7a89e23b3fd80610786", "ja": "未来がどうしても対決したい人？　いったい誰だ？", "zh": "未来无论如何都想对决的人？到底是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "0e5d390337e263c23ccb4ea7f5ba70ee6e537a2d6d5aaf17da3cf85cbcdd26f9", "ja": "それは、{$P$}さんです！", "zh": "那就是{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1012_p", "source_sha256": "01de68568a5c21774bf33c97a81ae23e67d7df4938c656451a4d086809a7f54b", "ja": "えっ……俺？", "zh": "诶……我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "e33586ffb5a1deecabf2b4560a936933b932b7b98e1f20e0d3bd76a6903816cd", "ja": "はい！　私がアイドルになってから、\n今までずーっと一緒ですけど……。", "zh": "是的！从我成为偶像以来，我们一直都在一起，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "ea152b51f437fd8ca402fceb2b55396ce8a5507eec079f2d32e354bf4da1b17e", "ja": "私の知らない顔が、きっとありますよね！？", "zh": "你一定也有我所不知道的一面吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "860b41a60648a14d8237cbb1c70963cff4330aff1caf099b4b3191c13f90930f", "ja": "私、{$P$}さんの見たことない顔、\n見てみたいです！", "zh": "我想看看{$P$}先生平时没见过的一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1547dad5ce9d070d41209dfbc596c2a609a9f1e995ce0c92e96e5e9b70cbe2c2", "ja": "お、おう、そうか……それでどんな対決がしたいんだ？\nできれば、あまり大変じゃないやつだと助かるけど。", "zh": "哦、哦，是吗……那你想进行什么样的对决？\n如果可以的话，最好是别太辛苦的那种。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "a5e97332df95617b2ddb54d9c5d6daefbbb23fd4cbde5b1b0c33528836db3698", "ja": "『いいところ探し』とか、どうですか？　劇場の\nみんなのいいところ、私はいっぱい知ってますけど……", "zh": "“寻找优点”之类的，怎么样？剧场\n大家的优点，我知道很多哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "1c5e4b1464b15b7baeba71c213a62fa507f3ca2ad3df2819a497284569ccb1cd", "ja": "{$P$}さんだってそうですよね？\nだから、対決したいです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也是这样的吧？\n所以，我想和您比一比！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a83af03be901a503a1c1952d86fbdac04c1925b1366f4ebbbdcfdb5610669a97", "ja": "それは……負けるわけにはいかないな。\n765プロのプロデューサーとして！", "zh": "那样的话……我可不能输啊。作为765专业制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "6412078744d0649bcbc330a14bb64126721115172e29a5d709266cb95f48689c", "ja": "やったー！　じゃあ、私から行きますね！\n静香ちゃんは頑張り屋さんでしょ。翼はオシャレで……", "zh": "太好啦！　那我先来哦！\n静香很努力对吧。翼很时髦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0733_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0733_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4c19b640f45e938df8252c2e62cdaa06b3b6e68c77d8da76458af3a77c40c294", "ja": "（未来の明るさ、前向きさは、いつも劇場を動かして\nいくな。そして未来に向かっていく。これからも……）", "zh": "（未来的开朗和积极，总是推动着剧场前进。今后也会继续朝着未来前进……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
